What is Home Title Insurance?
Home title insurance is a specialized financial product that protects property owners and lenders from financial losses due to title defects, such as liens, encumbrances, or ownership disputes. Unlike traditional property insurance that covers future damages, title insurance safeguards against past issues that could threaten ownership rights. This insurance is typically issued during property transactions and remains active for as long as the insured or their heirs maintain an interest in the property.

